<title>USA: Brock International Inc Q3 loss deepens.</title>
<headline>Brock International Inc Q3 loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended September 30</p>
<p>							 1996     1995</p>
<p>				(In Thousands; except per share data)</p>
<p>Revenues					    $5,474     $6,324</p>
<p>Operating Loss				     1,576	1,338</p>
<p>Loss Before Income Taxes			 1,557	1,247</p>
<p>Net Loss						 983	  790</p>
<p>Loss Per Share					 .20	  .16</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares Outstanding	  5,000	4,935</p>
<p>					 9 months ended September 30</p>
<p>							  1996	1995</p>
<p>Revenues					     $18,517   $19,272</p>
<p>Operating Loss					 2,878     5,475</p>
<p>Loss Before Income Taxes			   2,813     5,134</p>
<p>Net Loss						 1,758     3,236</p>
<p>Loss Per Share					  0.35	0.66</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares Outstanding	    5,000     4,915</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said that historically 83% of the licenses come in the last month, September, of the third quarter. This September only 18% of the licenses for the quarter were booked.</p>
</text>
